ia</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>JCY</given-names></name><name><surname>Kapp</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Bonnet</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Dick</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Purification of primitive human hematopoietic cells capable of repopulating immunodeficient mice</article-title><source>Proc Natl  Acad Sci USA</source><year>1997</year><volume>94</volume><fpage>5320</fpage><lpage>5325</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9144235</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>JCY</given-names></name><name><surname>Doedens</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Dick</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Primitive human hematopoietic cells are enriched in cord blood compared to adult bone marrow or mobilized peripherial blood as measured by the quantitative in vivo SCID-repopulating cell (SRC) assay</article-title><source>Blood</source><year>1997</year><volume>89</volume><fpage>3919</fpage><lpage>3925</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9166828</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lapidot</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Pflumio</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Doedens</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Murdoch</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name><surname>Dick</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cytokine stimulation of multilineage hematopoiesis from immature human cells engrafted  in <italic>scid</italic>mice</article-title><s